{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TjzuPV4BX466NybXe5PMYo","type":"tool_result","content":"340\t    //\n341\t    // `s_round` is degree `s_deg` so we evaluate it at `0, ..., =s_deg`. The prover skips\n342\t    // evaluation at `0` because the verifier can infer it from the previous round's\n343\t    // `s_{round-1}(r)` claim. The degree is constraint_degree + 1, where + 1 is from eq term\n344\t    let mle_rounds_span =\n345\t        info_span!(\"prover.rap_constraints.mle_rounds\", phase = \"prover\").entered();\n346\t    debug!(%s_deg);\n347\t    for round in 1..=n_max {\n348\t        let sp_round_evals = prover.sumcheck_polys_batch_eval(round, r[round - 1])?;\n349\t        let batch_s = prover.compute_batch_s_poly(sp_round_evals, num_traces, round, &mu_pows);\n350\t        let batch_s_evals = (1..=s_deg)\n351\t            .map(|i| batch_s.eval_at_point(EF::from_usize(i)))\n352\t            .collect_vec();\n353\t        for &eval in &batch_s_evals {\n354\t            transcript.observe_ext(eval);\n355\t        }\n356\t        sumcheck_round_polys.push(batch_s_evals);\n357\t\n358\t        let r_round = transcript.sample_ext();\n359\t        debug!(%round, %r_round);\n360\t        r.push(r_round);\n361\t        prover.prev_s_eval = batch_s.eval_at_point(r_round);\n362\t\n363\t        prover.fold_mle_evals(round, r_round)?;\n364\t    }\n365\t    assert_eq!(r.len(), n_max + 1);\n366\t\n367\t    let column_openings = prover.into_column_openings()?;\n368\t\n369\t    let need_rot_per_trace = ctx\n370\t        .per_trace\n371\t        .iter()\n372\t        .map(|(air_idx, _)| mpk.per_air[*air_idx].vk.params.need_rot)\n373\t        .collect::<Vec<_>>();\n374\t    // Observe common main openings first, and then preprocessed/cached\n375\t    for (need_rot, openings) in need_rot_per_trace.iter().zip(column_openings.iter()) {\n376\t        for (claim, claim_rot) in column_openings_by_rot(&openings[0], *need_rot) {\n377\t            transcript.observe_ext(claim);\n378\t            transcript.observe_ext(claim_rot);\n379\t        }\n380\t    }\n381\t    for (need_rot, openings) in need_rot_per_trace.iter().zip(column_openings.iter()) {\n382\t        for part in openings.iter().skip(1) {\n383\t            for (claim, claim_rot) in column_openings_by_rot(part, *need_rot) {\n384\t                transcript.observe_ext(claim);\n385\t                transcript.observe_ext(claim_rot);\n386\t            }\n387\t        }\n388\t    }\n389\t    drop(mle_rounds_span);\n390\t\n391\t    let batch_constraint_proof = BatchConstraintProof {\n392\t        numerator_term_per_air,\n393\t        denominator_term_per_air,\n394\t        univariate_round_coeffs: s_0_poly.into_coeffs(),"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9fb0c9c1-c32f-45e4-afe7-f108d55d0327","uuid":"c7bee1c0-ce8f-444e-9fdb-296cecb897eb","timestamp":"2026-04-12T19:28:40.580Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/src/logup_zerocheck/mod.rs","content":"    //\n    // `s_round` is degree `s_deg` so we evaluate it at `0, ..., =s_deg`. The prover skips\n    // evaluation at `0` because the verifier can infer it from the previous round's\n    // `s_{round-1}(r)` claim. The degree is constraint_degree + 1, where + 1 is from eq term\n    let mle_rounds_span =\n        info_span!(\"prover.rap_constraints.mle_rounds\", phase = \"prover\").entered();\n    debug!(%s_deg);\n    for round in 1..=n_max {\n        let sp_round_evals = prover.sumcheck_polys_batch_eval(round, r[round - 1])?;\n        let batch_s = prover.compute_batch_s_poly(sp_round_evals, num_traces, round, &mu_pows);\n        let batch_s_evals = (1..=s_deg)\n            .map(|i| batch_s.eval_at_point(EF::from_usize(i)))\n            .collect_vec();\n        for &eval in &batch_s_evals {\n            transcript.observe_ext(eval);\n        }\n        sumcheck_round_polys.push(batch_s_evals);\n\n        let r_round = transcript.sample_ext(